<p class="kt-adv-heading7_ac6a1c-8f wp-block-kadence-advancedheading vf-t-17 vf-mt-4" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading7_ac6a1c-8f">Both keep entries in your WordPress site. VuloForm goes further on being self-contained: it does not contact any external service on its own, has no telemetry, and does not store visitor IP addresses unless you enable it.</p>
<!-- /wp:kadence/advancedheading --></div></div>
<!-- /wp:kadence/column -->

<!-- wp:kadence/column {"borderWidth":["","","",""],"uniqueID":"7_5d6891-88","kbVersion":2,"className":"vf-reveal"} -->
